{"body":{"text":["A component is a holon, and says in it only what it says, its `input`, and its body where it is data. The code that realizes it on the web is the web's components' own, in `components/web/`, which give the web's chassis, in `chassis/web/`, the map of it, found by the component's id and never its name (`components/web/realized.ts`); components realized on another surface keep a map of their own. The chassis names no component: whoever starts it gives it the components, what each is called, and the one that chooses where several could draw a value; it stands apart from the components it draws, since a local chassis will come beside the web's: \"we know we're going to want local chassis anyway\" (20/19). *The chassis broken away, the author's, 20/17 and 20/19; where the code lies the session's (20/18); built.* Some components, as the reader and search, are defined wholly in the field, as layout and data (15/19). *Components as holons, settled 2026-11-11.* A component declares its `input` as a function does, a list of types matched by type (18/27), and is applied by a use, which names it and gives it what it is to show; mount folds into use, \"I'm fine with the dropping mount until we feel the need of it again\" (18/71). *Settled, 18/93; built.*"]},"id":"1M83S4TH1615000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["A component's look is the chassis's too, and shipped with the components, not with the site: \"the components look probably should be shipped with them. That's the component's responsibility\" (19/15). Styling has its degree, the author said, while what looks wholly different may want other components; so the look's variables are opened, to be tuned, by a knob component perhaps, and later taken from the field (19/15). On the web it stands in `components/web/look/`, a stylesheet a component, beneath them the page's ground and the tokens; one built stylesheet and the faces are what a site links, and beside it the chassis's own, its inspector's, in `chassis/web/look/`. The material, a stylesheet kept as text in glass that nothing read, was let go with its type: \"I don't see the point of the material\" (19/13, 19/15). *The look shipped with the components, its variables opened and the material let go, the author's, 19/15; its layout the session's; built.*"]},"id":"1M83S4TH1615001","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The page hosts and decides little: it starts the engine and each store in a worker of its own, mounts the stores, and draws its root read, Reader given the query's text, turning the address, back and forward, into what it draws. Which components show, and how they are laid out, are read from the field. It is `site/page.ts`, served at `/`, and puts the chassis and the components together; the language as glass ships it, its types and the functions everything applies found by route, is `language/shipped.ts`, and the interface is no module of the code but this program, the page running a chassis with its components on the engine (20/18)."]},"id":"1M83S4TH1615002","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["**native:** a function written in code."]},"id":"1M83S4TH1615003","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**use:** a function or a component applied to what it is given, a holon held where it is consumed."]},"id":"1M83S4TH1615004","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**input:** what a function or a component takes, a list of types, each named for pointing within."]},"id":"1M83S4TH1615005","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**placeholder:** a hole of a type, held at an input and named for pointing within; it holds nothing."]},"id":"1M83S4TH1615006","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**args:** what a use gives what it applies, in order."]},"id":"1M83S4TH1615007","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**pair:** two functions that name each other as their reverse."]},"id":"1M83S4TH1615008","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**way back:** a value proposed where a drawing stands, walked back through what gave it to a change that would give it."]},"id":"1M83S4TH1615009","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**chassis:** what draws components on one surface, the web or a phone."]},"id":"1M83S4TH161500A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**realization:** a component's code on one surface, given that surface's chassis by the components realized there, found by the component's id."]},"id":"1M83S4TH161500B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
